SUMMARY:Ferncliff Preserve & Bald Eagle Road Field Trip
DESCRIPTION:Ted Nichols will lead a field trip exploring Lancaster Conservancy’s Ferncliff Preserve and nearby Bald Eagle Road checking out some of Lancaster County’s prime breeding bird habitat. Meet at 7 a.m. at the main parking lot for Ferncliff Preserve located on Wildlife Preserve Road\, Drumore. Please contact Ted at 717-856-3851 or tanicholsii@gmail.com by 6 p.m. the day before if you plan to attend or have questions.  \n  \nNOTE: Parking is extremely limited at Ferncliff. If you are planning on coming with friends and/or family\, carpooling from an offsite location to Ferncliff is suggested rather than coming separately so we can reduce the number of vehicles requiring parking at the Preserve! \n  \nMeeting Location: Ferncliff Nature Preserve\, Wildlife Preserve Rd.\, Drumore\, PA 17518\nContact: Ted Nichols\, 717-856-3851 or tanicholsii@gmail.com 
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/ferncliff-preserve-bald-eagle-road-field-trip/
LOCATION:Ferncliff Preserve\, Wildlife Preserve Rd.\, Drumore\, PA\, 17518\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/IMG_0254.jpeg
END:VEVENT
