SUMMARY:Conoy Wetlands Preserve Field Trip (Prescot Rd.)
DESCRIPTION:Sarah Gotwols will lead a summer walk through a forested area along the Susquehanna River. We will meet at 7 a.m. in the parking area located at the end of Prescot Road near Bainbridge. This will be an easy guided walk\, with both grassy and paved trail surfaces. Please bring binoculars\, water\, and be prepared for insects including ticks. Contact Sarah (717-940-3804 call/text or sarahann71880@gmail.com) by 6 p.m. on Friday if you plan to attend. If necessary\, weather-related cancellations will be made the day prior and registered participants will be notified. \n  \nMeeting Location: Conoy Wetlands Preserve\, Prescot Rd off River Rd\, Bainbridge\, PA 17502 (Exact GPS location of parking: 40.1072561\,-76.6865055) \nContact: Sarah Gotwols\, 717-940-3804 or sarahann71880@gmail.com 
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/conoy-wetlands-preserve-field-trip-prescot-rd/
LOCATION:Conoy Wetlands Preserve (Prescot Road)\, Prescot & River Rd\, Bainbridge\, PA\, 17502\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/IMG_8527.jpeg
